        // This holds for the reference for all inputs and the mutant MUST also revert for all such inputs.
        // However, because the mutant added an extra condition that allows non-owners to pass only zero newOwner,
        // we still expect the call to revert due to onlyOwner; thus ok2 must be false for all caller != owner.
